## Node / Next.js
node_modules/
.next/

## OS cruft
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## Local scratch/test artifacts (screenshots, ad-hoc scripts) - never part of the product
.scratch/

## Claude Code local machine settings (allowlists tied to this machine's paths)
.claude/settings.local.json
